<!-- SEOAI:FAQ:START --><dl class="container-custom py-12 md:py-20">
  <dt class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-normal text-gray-900 mb-6">What is Stella Login AI Commerce Agent?</dt>
  <dd class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-zunkiree-600 font-medium mb-6 gap-3">Stella Login AI Commerce Agent is an autonomous AI agent that sells for you 24/7 on the Agentic ecommerce platform. It manages the entire customer buying journey, from product discovery to checkout.</dd>
  <dt class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-normal text-gray-900 mb-6">How does Stella handle customer interactions?</dt>
  <dd class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-zunkiree-600 font-medium mb-6 gap-3">Stella's AI agents understand customer intent and are capable of guiding them through the purchasing process without human intervention. They provide answers to questions, recommend products, and handle objections naturally.</dd>
  <dt class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-normal text-gray-900 mb-6">What payment methods does Stella support?</dt>
  <dd class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-zunkiree-600 font-medium mb-6 gap-3">Stella integrates with Nepal payment methods like eSewa and Khalti, as well as international gateways like Stripe, allowing customers to complete purchases in their preferred payment method.</dd>
  <dt class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-normal text-gray-900 mb-6">Can Stella integrate with existing ecommerce platforms?</dt>
  <dd class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-zunkiree-600 font-medium mb-6 gap-3">Yes, Stella works with various platforms such as Daraz, Shopify, WooCommerce, and custom ecommerce solutions, enabling deployment across multiple sites while maintaining consistent AI-powered experiences.</dd>
  <dt class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-normal text-gray-900 mb-6">What are the immediate benefits of using Stella?</dt>
  <dd class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-zunkiree-600 font-medium mb-6 gap-3">Stella offers several benefits, including a 35% higher conversion rate, 60% fewer support tickets, and 24/7 availability, alongside 3x faster response times.</dd>
  <dt class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-normal text-gray-900 mb-6">Is Stella secure for business use?</dt>
  <dd class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-zunkiree-600 font-medium mb-6 gap-3">Yes, Stella is SOC 2 compliant, ensuring enterprise security with data encrypted both at rest and in transit, so your data remains secure.</dd>
